# Music files (already included)

This project includes 3 **Creative Commons** tracks in `public/`:
- `calm.mp3` (default)
- `uplift.mp3` (for "I feel tired")
- `comfort.mp3` (for "I feel numb")

They switch automatically based on what she picks.

## Want to use your own songs?
Replace the MP3 files in `public/` (keep the same filenames), or update `src/content/defaultContent.ts`.

Note: if you use copyrighted songs from Spotify/YouTube, you usually can't legally bundle them into a website.
Use royalty-free / Creative Commons music instead.
